class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: an explicit runtime integer conversion traps when its source is outside the destination range
constructs: 0150, 0310, 0700, 1670, 1950, 1960
program: main.ldn
traps: yes
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, macos-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
